    <!-- ==================== HEADER ==================== -->
    <header>
        <span class="eyebrow">Edition 2 · Exam AND Beyond</span>
        <h1>☸️ Kubernetes CKA — Certified Kubernetes Administrator</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">The Complete, Self-Contained Mastery Guide</p>
        <p class="description">From total beginner to CKA-certified administrator — and beyond. Every concept is built on the <strong>easypj</strong> Django project (<em>jobpost</em> app, PostgreSQL), aligned to the official <strong>2025 CKA syllabus</strong> and packed with diagrams, labs, and real-world Day-2 operations.</p>
        <div class="header-tags">
            <span class="tag beginner">🟢 Beginner-Friendly</span>
            <span class="tag">☸️ Kubernetes v1.31+</span>
            <span class="tag">🐍 Django · easypj / jobpost</span>
            <span class="tag">📚 14 Parts · 45 Chapters</span>
            <span class="tag exam">🎯 2025 Syllabus · 100% Coverage</span>
            <span class="tag">📋 12 Appendices</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ==================== MAIN ==================== -->
    <main>
        <div class="intro-callout" id="overview">
            <p>👋 <strong>Welcome.</strong> This is a complete, self-contained path from <em>"what is a container?"</em> to <strong>CKA-certified administrator</strong> — and the real-world operations beyond the exam. You never need another doc, blog, book, or video.</p>
            <p>Everything is taught on one real app, <strong>easypj</strong> (a Django <em>jobpost</em> project on PostgreSQL): you'll containerize it, deploy it, scale it, secure it, break it, fix it, and ship it. Aligned 100% to the <strong>official 2025 CKA syllabus</strong>. Use the <strong>☰ sidebar</strong> to jump anywhere.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- ==================== TABLE OF CONTENTS (cards) ==================== -->
        <section class="toc-section" id="toc">
            <h2>📚 Complete Table of Contents</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">14 parts · 45 chapters · 12 appendices — grouped beginner → core CKA domains → mastery &amp; beyond.</p>
            <div class="toc-grid">
                <div class="toc-card"><a href="#part1">
                    <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">🟢</span><span class="card-part-badge beginner">Beginner</span></div>
                    <h3>Part 1: Foundations</h3><p class="card-subtitle">Think like Kubernetes</p>
                    <p>Why K8s exists, containers &amp; Docker, cluster architecture, and the core objects you use every day.</p>
                    <div class="card-chapters"><span class="chapter-tag">Ch 1–4</span><span class="chapter-tag">~7h</span></div>
                </a></div>
                <div class="toc-card"><a href="#part2">
                    <div class="card-header"><span class="card-icon">🛠️</span><span class="card-part-badge beginner">Beginner</span></div>
                    <h3>Part 2: Hands-On Basics</h3><p class="card-subtitle">Make it run</p>
                    <p>Set up a cluster, master kubectl, write YAML, and deploy easypj end-to-end for the first time.</p>
                    <div class="card-chapters"><span class="chapter-tag">Ch 5–8</span><span class="chapter-tag">~8h</span></div>
                </a></div>
