                <h5>🧪 Drill</h5>
                <p><strong>Timed challenge (target: 7 minutes):</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>1. Create namespace <code>hardened</code> with PSA enforce=restricted</li>
                    <li>2. Try to deploy a pod with default settings — it should be REJECTED</li>
                    <li>3. Fix the pod: add <code>runAsNonRoot: true</code>, <code>runAsUser: 1000</code>, <code>seccompProfile: {type: RuntimeDefault}</code>, drop ALL capabilities</li>
                    <li>4. Deploy the fixed pod — should succeed</li>
                    <li>5. Verify the API server has <code>PodSecurity</code> admission plugin enabled</li>
