            └────────────────────────┬────────────────────────┘
                                     ▼
            Ch 34 CKA TROUBLESHOOTING SCENARIOS (the playbook)
   ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   the through-line: a disciplined symptom → command → cause → fix loop
   that turns a broken easypj into a passing exam task.
</pre>
