        <article class="chapter" id="ch31">
            <div class="chapter-intro">
                <h2 class="chapter-title">Chapter 31 · Debugging Pods &amp; Containers</h2>
                <p class="chapter-lead">Pod lifecycle, status codes, debugging toolkit, essential debug commands, and common troubleshooting scenarios. This is the <strong>heaviest CKA exam domain at 30%</strong> — master these skills.</p>
                <div class="chapter-meta">
                    <span class="meta-tag">🔴 Advanced</span>
                    <span class="meta-tag">⏱️ ~2 hours</span>
                    <span class="meta-tag">🔍 Debug</span>
