            <div class="learning-objectives">
                <h4>🎯 What You'll Learn</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ Pod lifecycle phases — Pending, Running, Succeeded, Failed, Unknown</li>
                    <li>✅ Container status codes and what each exit code means</li>
                    <li>✅ The systematic debugging toolkit — describe, logs, exec, events</li>
                    <li>✅ Ephemeral debug containers for distroless images</li>
                    <li>✅ Real-world troubleshooting scenarios with easypj Django app</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cka-chapter-relevance">
                <span class="relevance-label">🎓 CKA Relevance</span>
