            <div class="cka-exam-tip">
                <h5>🎯 Troubleshooting is 30% of CKA — The Heaviest Domain</h5>
                <p>Every CKA exam includes multiple debugging tasks. You <strong>must</strong> have these commands in muscle memory:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>kubectl describe pod &lt;name&gt;</code> — always check Events at the bottom</li>
                    <li><code>kubectl logs &lt;pod&gt; --previous</code> — see why a crashed container failed</li>
                    <li><code>kubectl exec -it &lt;pod&gt; -- /bin/sh</code> — shell into a running container</li>
                    <li><code>kubectl get events --sort-by='.lastTimestamp'</code> — cluster-wide event timeline</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

