                    <li>✅ <strong>Configure cloud-native storage</strong> — StorageClass with CSI drivers for AWS, Azure, GCP</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Integrate cloud identity</strong> — IRSA, Workload Identity, Managed Identity for pod-level access</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Deploy easypj to any cloud</strong> — complete walkthrough from cluster creation to running app</li>
