                <h5>🎯 CKA Exam Note</h5>
                <p>The CKA exam uses a vanilla Kubernetes cluster, not managed cloud. However, understanding cloud Kubernetes helps you recognize <strong>what kubeadm automates</strong> vs what cloud providers abstract away. These are skills you need the day after passing CKA.</p>
            </div>

