                <ul>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs)</strong> — extend the K8s API with your own resource types</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>The Operator Pattern</strong> — CRD + custom controller for application lifecycle automation</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>API Aggregation Layer</strong> — extending the API server with additional API servers</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>kubectl Plugins</strong> — extend kubectl with krew and custom commands</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Admission Webhooks</strong> — ValidatingWebhookConfiguration and MutatingWebhookConfiguration</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</strong> — CEL-based policy enforcement without webhooks</li>
                </ul>
