        <article class="chapter" id="ch40">
            <div class="chapter-intro">
                <h2 class="chapter-title">Chapter 40 · Kubernetes Policies Deep Dive</h2>
                <p class="chapter-lead">Master the full range of Kubernetes policy enforcement — Pod Security Standards, ValidatingAdmissionPolicy with CEL, LimitRange vs ResourceQuota, PID limits, topology constraints, and an overview of external policy engines (OPA Gatekeeper &amp; Kyverno) — all with <strong>easypj</strong> project examples.</p>
