                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="learning-objectives">
                <h4>🎯 What You'll Learn</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Pod Security Standards</strong> — privileged, baseline, and restricted profiles with Pod Security Admission</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</strong> — in-cluster CEL-based policy enforcement patterns</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>LimitRange vs ResourceQuota</strong> — per-pod defaults vs namespace-wide totals</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>PID Limits</strong> — protecting nodes from fork bombs</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>Topology Spread Constraints</strong> — policy-driven workload distribution</li>
                    <li>✅ <strong>External Policy Engines</strong> — OPA Gatekeeper and Kyverno overview</li>
                </ul>
