            <ul>
                <li><strong>1 week behind:</strong> Skip the review lab days — focus on core content only, do labs on weekends</li>
                <li><strong>2+ weeks behind:</strong> Extend to a 12-week plan, but <strong>never skip</strong> Weeks 8 (Cluster Admin) or 9 (Troubleshooting)</li>
                <li><strong>Struggling with a topic:</strong> Watch a KodeKloud video on it + do 3 Killercoda scenarios. Don't spend more than 2 extra days per topic</li>
                <li><strong>Not confident at Week 10:</strong> Postpone the exam (you can reschedule). It's better to take an extra 2 weeks than to burn your free retake</li>
